# Android (`cam.docscan`)

- Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, CameraX, Room, WorkManager
- `applicationId` / namespace: **cam.docscan**
- minSdk 26+; request `CAMERA` and `READ_MEDIA_IMAGES` just-in-time (see `docs/permissions.md`)
- Import via Photo Picker; suggest feature may use `READ_MEDIA_IMAGES`
- Play Billing for Pro; no competitor native `.so` from APK extracts
- Keep release keystore paths in gitignored `keystore.properties`
